{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37628","headline":"京兆府试残月如新月 · 郑谷","name":"京兆府试残月如新月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荣落何相似，初终却一般。\n犹疑和夕照，谁信堕朝寒。\n水木辉华别，诗家比象难。\n佳人应误拜，栖鸟反求安。\n屈指期轮满，何心谓影残。\n庾楼清赏处，吟彻曙钟看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37628.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37628","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}